      <textAnnotation id="sid-26B33910-21C4-4E0E-AF74-5AE6EC3EF1AA" signavio:alignment="left" textFormat="text/plain">
         <extensionElements>
            <signavio:signavioMetaData metaKey="bordercolor" metaValue="#000000"/>
         </extensionElements>
         <text>It is assumed that the ethical committee of the initiator has already approved the clinical trial idea and protocol, and therefore, the focus is on modeling the interactions with the collaborators.</text>
      </textAnnotation>
